{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>34歲女星葉蒨文於TVB59周年台慶夜換上純白深V戰衣，憑藉傲人身段與修長美腿瞬間成為全場鎂光燈焦點。她與同場 …</p><p></p>\n<p>34歲女星葉蒨文於TVB59周年台慶夜換上純白深V戰衣，憑藉傲人身段與修長美腿瞬間成為全場鎂光燈焦點。她與同場現身男友曾展望在紅地氈上擦出激烈火花，令現場氣氛瞬間炒熱。男方其後一個無預警舉動直接引爆網絡廣泛關注。</p>\n<h2>電視城噴水池旁葉蒨文展現極致性感</h2>\n<p>當晚盛會在電視城戶外噴水池旁舉行，葉蒨文以一身純白掛頸晚裝強勢登場。這套戰衣正面採用大膽水滴形深V鏤空剪裁，毫不吝嗇展現澎湃事業線，腰側與高領頸圈位置更綴滿奢華閃耀水鑽。裙擺側面超高開衩直達大腿根部，完美勾勒出玲瓏浮凸曲線，轉身後大露背設計配合水鑽飾邊，讓白滑玉背在夜色燈光映照下表露無遺。</p>\n<h2>男友曾展望公開力讚猶如希臘女神</h2>\n<p>面對這身震撼視覺極致打扮，情侶檔同行踏上紅地氈男友曾展望亦無法掩飾震撼心情。曾展望接受傳媒訪問時大方承認，早在化妝間已經忍不住偷望女友，更當眾公開盛讚這身造型高貴迷人，形容她猶如「希臘女神雅典娜」降臨。女方隨後亦親自於社交平台公開高清造型照，特意配以英文「Moonlight on white」呼應純白造型與優美夜景。</p>\n<h2>參與真人騷《女神配對計劃》人氣急升</h2>\n<p>現年34歲葉蒨文與男友曾展望早於去年因共同參與無綫戀愛真人騷《女神配對計劃》而結緣，兩人成功配對後雙雙迎來事業高峰。女方更憑藉該節目光環與出色表現，成功勇奪「飛躍進步女藝員」殊榮。這段從螢幕走到現實戀情一直備受外界矚目，兩人頻頻以情侶檔姿態出席各大公開活動。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551840786259242_2320791396b056fc87e040.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb59周年台慶 葉蒨文 （圖片來源：IG@sophieysm）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551840786259242_2320791396b056fc87e040.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@sophieysm）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>網民湧入社交平台洗版激讚仙氣迫人</h2>\n<p>高清近照於網絡正式曝光後，大批網民隨即湧入留言區展開瘋狂洗版，對這身大膽破格打扮給予極高評價。大批粉絲留下心心眼表情符號，並紛紛激讚「着白色好有仙氣」以及「又靚又性感」。有群眾形容相中人「每一張都靚，白月光咁」，更有激動支持者直接留言笑言「Sophie被你電親，點算啊啊啊，太靚」。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_2172068696b0117f624c80.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb59周年台慶 葉蒨文 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_2172068696b0117f624c80.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551841032586828_5293879136b056fcae19c1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb59周年台慶 葉蒨文 （圖片來源：IG@sophieysm）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551841032586828_5293879136b056fcae19c1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@sophieysm）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551841347677631_15129664646b056fcde67b0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb59周年台慶 葉蒨文 （圖片來源：IG@sophieysm）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551841347677631_15129664646b056fcde67b0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@sophieysm）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551841599513809_5933017986b056fd058f9c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb59周年台慶 葉蒨文 （圖片來源：IG@sophieysm）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551841599513809_5933017986b056fd058f9c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@sophieysm）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551841886779992_9432948746b056fd347146.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb59周年台慶 葉蒨文 前後都露（圖片來源：IG@sophieysm）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551841886779992_9432948746b056fd347146.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>前後都露（圖片來源：IG@sophieysm）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/tvb59%e5%91%a8%e5%b9%b4%e5%8f%b0%e6%85%b6/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">TVB59周年台慶</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9b%be%e5%b1%95%e6%9c%9b/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">曾展望</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%91%89%e8%92%a8%e6%96%87/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">葉蒨文</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：IG@sophieysm、TVB資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3549434\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 24 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T12:43:52.637899+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1263,"images":6,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T11:07:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T12:37:25.366132+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T12:37:25.366132+00:00","content_hash":"157bf57858cc655614ae125de78664f86c63a9a052d2ddcff5f8df2fbc4f3f99","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}